1	line	Player	Who are you, and what are you doing here?
1	line	Golrie	I'm Golrie, and this is my home. Thing is, as you can see, I've got a small problem. Those hob-gobs are all over the place trying to steal my family's heirlooms. I've been stuck here for ages!
1	line	Player	Do you need some help?
1	line	Golrie	Oh don't worry, I'm sure I'll work something out. I just need some time to think.
1	line	Player	In that case, do you mind if I have a look around?
1	line	Golrie	No, of course not.
